  "description": "GOOD THINGS, SMALL PACKAGES\nThis Vamoose Mammoth 24 ST AWD electric bicycle has become famous due to its smaller (16.5\") frame and 24\" tires but still comes standard with the powerful dual 52V 500W motors, torque sensor, and optional dual battery capability.\nMAMMOTH 24 AWD STEP THROUGH!\nGet the power of the Mammoth in a slightly smaller package! The Vamoose Mammoth 24 has the same dual 52V 500W motors (front and rear) as its older sibling, only with a smaller 16” frame and 26” x 4.0” tires. The Mammoth 24 allows everyone to comfortably sling mud and crush fresh powder! The Mammoth 24 comes standard with a truly mammoth 52V 20Ah battery producing an incredible 1040 Watt-hours of performance - a +84 km range! Add a second battery for a mind-melting extra 60 km range!\nThis cycle comes standard with the following adders:\n\n• Dual 52V 500W motors\n\n• 52V 20 Ah Samsung Battery with additional battery optional\n\n• A 6061 aircraft aluminum frame with alloy front forks\n\n• 24\" x 4.0” Fat Tires\n\n• Front and rear fenders\n\nKD986 w Bluetooth, down sampling, USB\n\nBOXER 100 mm travel air fork\n\nTektro Hydraulic E350 203mm rotor\n\nRear, with front mount option\n\n80 Nm MAX Torque per motor\n\n4-6 hrs.\n\nYES\n\nWEIGHTS AND DIMENSIONS",
